<title>USA: Fort Worth, Texas, $15 mln won by Hutchinson.</title>
<headline>Fort Worth, Texas, $15 mln won by Hutchinson.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Shockey Erley said it won $15 million of Fort Worth, Texas, general purpose limited tax bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.5478 percent.</p>
</text>
